WEBVTT

02:08.480 --> 02:09.790
Hot...

02:09.790 --> 02:11.190
Burning...

02:11.190 --> 02:13.100
Electrifying...

02:13.100 --> 02:14.760
I want to come...

02:14.760 --> 02:16.200
I need release...

02:16.200 --> 02:19.520
I can't... take it any more!

02:22.460 --> 02:24.710
Damn it...!

02:24.710 --> 02:29.630
Fuck, shit...!

02:34.840 --> 02:37.240
I love you, Riki.

02:44.080 --> 02:47.800
I'm going to receive a pairing soon.

02:47.800 --> 02:50.900
When that happens, I won't be able to see you anymore.

02:50.900 --> 02:54.300
So please, Riki...

02:54.300 --> 02:56.090
Hold me.

03:00.590 --> 03:05.230
I love you, Riki. I love you.

03:13.370 --> 03:14.760
No!

03:14.760 --> 03:19.250
Riki! Riki!

03:22.450 --> 03:24.750
Such a fool, that Mimea.

03:24.970 --> 03:28.040
I know, right? Can't believe she did it with Riki.

03:28.040 --> 03:31.470
A pure-bred born from the Academy, and a mongrel of the slums...

03:31.470 --> 03:33.840
There's no way they'd suit each other!

03:33.840 --> 03:37.810
That mongrel's going to be punished, isn't he?

03:37.810 --> 03:38.930
Tough luck for him.

03:39.180 --> 03:42.650
It doesn't make sense that a mongrel like him would be a Blondie's pet.

03:42.650 --> 03:44.570
He should take a look at himself.

04:12.070 --> 04:13.420
How is it?

04:13.420 --> 04:15.540
Starting to wear you down a bit now?

04:15.540 --> 04:19.440
Come on, give me a break already...

04:19.440 --> 04:24.590
Mimea's pairing partner had already been decided.

04:24.590 --> 04:32.190
And yet you made shambles of everything, or so Raoul snapped at me.

04:32.190 --> 04:35.390
This is nothing more than the punishment you earned.

04:42.300 --> 04:44.060
Riki!

04:46.070 --> 04:47.770
Riki!

04:47.770 --> 04:49.270
Mimea...

04:49.270 --> 04:51.200
Riki...

04:52.010 --> 04:56.760
Pets like you do not have the freedom to choose your partners.

04:56.760 --> 04:59.650
So tell it to her straight.

05:00.450 --> 05:03.900
All you were interested in was her female body.

05:03.900 --> 05:11.430
As long as you could have sex with a female, you didn't care if it was Mimea or not.

05:11.430 --> 05:13.330
I'm right, aren't I?

05:14.830 --> 05:16.710
That's a lie!

05:16.710 --> 05:20.720
Everyone's trying to tear us apart!

05:20.720 --> 05:24.090
Do you know who Raoul-sama picked for me as my partner?

05:24.090 --> 05:27.090
It's that Jana! I hate it!

05:27.090 --> 05:28.740
I hate it!

05:29.680 --> 05:33.880
No... Mimea... stop!

05:33.880 --> 05:38.340
You're different from the others, right?

05:38.340 --> 05:41.190
You love only me, don't you?

05:41.190 --> 05:42.470
Right?

05:42.470 --> 05:45.880
I don't want to have Jana's children!

05:45.880 --> 05:48.700
I want to have your babies, Riki.

05:52.200 --> 05:54.520
Why aren't you talking?

05:54.520 --> 05:57.050
Why won't you look me in the eye?

05:57.050 --> 06:01.080
Riki, I hate this! Riki!!

06:01.080 --> 06:04.910
I trust you've learned your lesson about playing with fire.

06:05.250 --> 06:07.250
Poor creature...

06:07.750 --> 06:16.260
How wounded she would be, if she knew you were only using her as a tool to soil my reputation.

06:16.260 --> 06:17.660
You're wrong!

06:19.590 --> 06:21.890
How am I wrong?

06:32.770 --> 06:35.270
Do you want me to make you come?

06:51.090 --> 06:56.570
You had a little fling with Mimea behind my back, didn't you?

06:56.570 --> 07:02.430
Surely you didn't believe it would all just blow over without any consequences.

07:02.430 --> 07:06.200
I only did it... once... with Mimea!

07:06.200 --> 07:09.430
One time or a hundred, there is no difference.

07:09.430 --> 07:14.210
You slept with her. That alone is enough.

07:16.650 --> 07:22.570
Your body is melting with yearning, so much more than usual...

07:22.570 --> 07:27.390
I believe your favorite place to be touched was right... here.

07:32.970 --> 07:35.420
I won't do it anymore...!

07:35.420 --> 07:38.080
I'll never... do it again!

07:38.080 --> 07:43.240
So please... stop...!

07:43.240 --> 07:47.250
I'll make you come, as many times as it takes

07:47.250 --> 07:52.020
until you have repented sufficiently for touching Mimea.

07:53.390 --> 07:56.110
You are my pet.

07:56.110 --> 08:00.660
I'll pound that fact into the very marrow of your bones.

08:21.650 --> 08:27.050
- Two Years Later -

08:46.710 --> 08:50.160
Riki-sama, are you going out?

08:50.160 --> 08:51.360
Yeah.

08:51.360 --> 08:53.210
Have a pleasant day.

09:05.220 --> 09:09.560
Are you going back there again? You refuse to change, don't you.

09:10.400 --> 09:15.740
Even though you know that Iason-sama hasn't even the slightest intention of letting you go.

09:18.870 --> 09:25.190
In Eos, pets are no more than an accessory to show one's status.

09:25.190 --> 09:32.100
However, Iason-sama has never taken Riki to any sex parties.

09:32.100 --> 09:35.050
He makes love to his pet himself.

09:49.040 --> 09:55.770
A Blondie in the city of Tanagura lusts after the lowest of the lowest - a mongrel of the slums.

09:55.770 --> 10:01.230
They say it's a scandal that's never been heard of, one that upturns all the rules of Eos.

10:01.230 --> 10:03.320
It's already been three years.

10:08.690 --> 10:14.230
As I thought, he didn't go to the salon, but to the entrance hall.

10:33.880 --> 10:37.530
You could say the Pet Ring serves the same purpose as ID.

10:37.530 --> 10:41.350
You can go anywhere you please, as long as you are wearing it.

10:41.690 --> 10:45.760
Of course, there are still places you cannot access.

10:46.590 --> 10:51.010
So all that means is I'm being watched wherever the hell I go!

10:51.010 --> 10:53.600
There's no freedom anywhere at all!

10:54.230 --> 10:56.620
Please come back.

10:56.620 --> 10:59.890
The security guard has warned you...

10:59.890 --> 11:03.380
...not to set foot in the entrance hall.

11:03.710 --> 11:05.530
Well, you can shove all of that up your ass!

11:05.530 --> 11:08.700
I don't give a shit what the security guards say,

11:08.700 --> 11:13.090
I'm going where I want to go. End of story!

11:30.570 --> 11:35.610
What are you looking at, on the other side of the door?

11:38.180 --> 11:41.930
The slum is a worthless garbage heap of the lowest and the worst.

11:41.930 --> 11:45.060
The slum is where you hit rock bottom.

11:45.060 --> 11:47.390
At least that was what I always thought.

11:49.860 --> 11:51.860
Even so...

11:51.860 --> 11:55.210
Compared to the pets kept caged here in Eos,

11:55.210 --> 11:59.530
it's far better to live in the slums and have the freedom to be low and rotten!

12:00.270 --> 12:03.930
Pet Rings are a sign of high class.

12:03.930 --> 12:07.020
You're so loved by Iason-sama...

12:07.020 --> 12:10.080
...to the envy of other pets.

12:11.610 --> 12:14.580
But the only person who truly believes that...

12:15.080 --> 12:16.950
...is you.

12:17.520 --> 12:20.970
As long as this Pet Ring is biting into my flesh,

12:20.970 --> 12:22.670
there's nowhere for me to run.

12:22.670 --> 12:25.860
I know that!

12:25.860 --> 12:30.390
Even if you were able to go beyond those gates to the world outside,

12:30.390 --> 12:35.380
as long as that ring still shackles you,

12:35.380 --> 12:40.270
Can you fly, even with that knowledge?

12:44.280 --> 12:50.280
If, just for one moment, you had the chance to go past those gates,

12:50.650 --> 12:53.790
what would you do?

12:53.790 --> 12:55.470
Shit!

12:55.470 --> 12:57.310
If only these doors would open,

12:57.310 --> 13:01.990
I could run away from this hellish place and regain my freedom!

13:29.790 --> 13:35.360
I see. So that is your answer?

13:47.470 --> 13:52.280
For a pet to escape past the security of Eos...

13:52.500 --> 13:55.280
This is a scandal never heard of before.

13:55.280 --> 13:58.670
As the one responsible for the Eos district,

13:58.670 --> 14:01.700
this must be a blow to your pride.

14:01.700 --> 14:07.360
I thought he would have lost his wild edge over the Mimea incident.

14:07.960 --> 14:10.560
That mongrel really is unyielding.

14:10.780 --> 14:14.680
Seems like his usual innocence is all an act.

14:14.680 --> 14:19.840
He broke free from the security guard, and got all the way to the Plage.

14:21.770 --> 14:25.640
In some ways, he's doing the slum people proud.

14:31.280 --> 14:34.900
Even in Eos' rock solid security systems,

14:34.900 --> 14:37.120
there are unexpected holes.

14:37.120 --> 14:40.480
You speak almost as if you have no care in this matter.

14:40.480 --> 14:44.740
Do you recognize the severity of this situation?

14:44.740 --> 14:46.130
That is without question.

14:46.130 --> 14:50.150
Even though this is only the escape of a pet,

14:50.150 --> 14:53.360
the breaking of the security system is a crime which holds a heavy sentence.

14:53.360 --> 15:00.040
There is no way a mere pet would be able to hack into the security system.

15:00.040 --> 15:05.450
If he is cunning, there are many ways he can get around it. That's his true nature, isn't it?

15:05.450 --> 15:09.410
If so, he would not have stumbled around like he did.

15:09.410 --> 15:14.680
He would have carefully planned and executed his escape.

15:14.680 --> 15:18.460
At least he would have the sufficient intelligence to do that.

15:18.460 --> 15:22.600
However, there is a possibility that the Furniture is his accomplice.

15:22.600 --> 15:24.950
I plan to look into that.

15:24.950 --> 15:26.810
Don't go easy on him.

15:27.740 --> 15:30.430
I am not that soft.

15:30.430 --> 15:35.460
Nevertheless, our first priority is to revise the security system.

15:35.460 --> 15:37.880
What will we do with him?

15:37.880 --> 15:44.760
Looks like you'll have to give him a lesson in bed, Iason.

15:44.950 --> 15:48.950
With this advice from the supervisor of Eos,

15:48.950 --> 15:51.760
I intend to execute it earnestly.

15:51.760 --> 15:56.350
You may be used to his misdemeanors by now,

15:56.350 --> 16:00.340
but this time, his wrongs must not be taken lightly.

16:01.010 --> 16:03.540
I will remember your advice.

16:03.740 --> 16:07.460
We're also interested to see...

16:07.460 --> 16:11.820
...how long your patience will hold out.

16:11.820 --> 16:13.870
Incidentally, I would like to propose...

16:13.870 --> 16:18.110
...a thorough investigation on the Furniture.

16:18.110 --> 16:19.340
You're right.

16:19.340 --> 16:25.080
Right now, we leave the Furniture of the house to manage pets.

16:25.080 --> 16:31.340
It might also be a good idea to do some maintenance on the mentality of Furniture.

16:31.340 --> 16:36.080
In other words, we should eliminate all those who might cause trouble.

16:51.620 --> 16:54.630
No, that's not true.

16:54.630 --> 16:59.480
I hacked the security completely voluntarily.

16:59.480 --> 17:02.800
Riki-sama is completely unaware of this.

17:03.570 --> 17:07.340
It was a crime of conscience.

17:08.140 --> 17:11.330
It must be much easier...

17:11.330 --> 17:15.460
...to accept the fate of becoming a pet,

17:15.460 --> 17:17.590
and to let oneself slip into the darkness.

17:17.590 --> 17:20.370
But Riki-sama cannot do that.

17:20.370 --> 17:23.210
In addition to his dirty chains of a pet,

17:23.210 --> 17:26.110
Riki-sama was also a mongrel of the slum.

17:26.110 --> 17:29.350
I envied him, and my heart felt sorrow for him.

17:29.350 --> 17:35.340
It agonized me more than anything, knowing that I could do nothing but watch.

17:35.340 --> 17:41.360
Pet and Furniture. Creatures locked in the same cage.

17:41.360 --> 17:44.910
But they can't even lick each other's wounds.

17:44.910 --> 17:50.680
Maybe I just wanted to know.

17:50.680 --> 17:54.400
To know if Riki still had the pride of a mongrel.

17:54.400 --> 17:59.110
Or if he has stooped to the level of a lewd pet.

17:59.110 --> 18:07.200
And you threw away all of your accomplishments as a Blondie's Furniture for that?

18:07.200 --> 18:12.340
Was that just because he was also a mongrel of the slum?

18:12.340 --> 18:16.410
I did this out of my own ego.

18:16.410 --> 18:21.050
Please be forgiving of Riki-sama.

18:22.250 --> 18:25.620
Ego... huh?

18:26.650 --> 18:30.360
If Riki knew the truth behind this, he would lament it.

18:30.360 --> 18:36.880
Even if he does not shed a tear for himself, he'd wail for Daryl's execution.

18:36.880 --> 18:44.770
And, with his death, Daryl will forever be engraved in his memory.

18:44.770 --> 18:48.610
I cannot... allow that.

19:00.250 --> 19:07.540
It's been a long time since I've seen such rage on your face, Riki.

19:07.540 --> 19:14.200
Has your long struggle with the security guard awakened the wild mongrel in you?

19:14.200 --> 19:17.840
Shut up! Do whatever you want!

19:17.840 --> 19:20.760
So that means you've prepared yourself.

19:20.760 --> 19:22.530
How admirable of you.

19:22.530 --> 19:26.980
Then, shall I show you some pain?

19:32.490 --> 19:34.700
Do you remember now, Riki?

19:34.700 --> 19:41.070
There is no place for you to escape while the pet ring is biting into your flesh.

19:41.070 --> 19:45.710
But, why do you do such foolish things?

19:45.710 --> 19:51.700
Pets... are the lowliest of shit!

19:56.110 --> 19:59.660
Do you hate making love that bad?

19:59.660 --> 20:01.510
You make me sick!

20:03.710 --> 20:06.690
Your bark is louder than your bite.

20:06.690 --> 20:11.620
Are you barking desperately now that you're in this pitiful position?

20:13.190 --> 20:15.540
But it's not just pain.

20:15.540 --> 20:19.450
The ring has given you other sensations too, hasn't it?

20:19.450 --> 20:22.100
Am I wrong, Riki?

20:33.850 --> 20:36.630
If I touch you here,

20:36.630 --> 20:40.050
you become surprisingly obedient.

20:41.990 --> 20:45.490
You stop saying things I don't like to hear.

20:45.490 --> 20:49.230
Or... do you like it here better?

20:50.160 --> 20:53.970
I don't even need to drug you.

20:53.970 --> 20:58.450
Your body heats up so much just by my mere touch.

20:58.450 --> 21:02.270
How could you argue that you're not my pet?

21:03.410 --> 21:05.510
Shit...

21:05.510 --> 21:09.110
Who owns you?

21:12.850 --> 21:16.250
I don't belong to anyone.

21:22.130 --> 21:24.630
You are a stubborn lowlife.

22:37.640 --> 22:41.270
Isn't this the border?

22:41.270 --> 22:42.460
That's right.

22:42.460 --> 22:45.660
If you pass those gates, you'll be in the slum.

22:45.660 --> 22:48.880
ls this your bad idea of a joke?

22:48.880 --> 22:54.590
Would you rather have stayed at Raoul's lab to be his white mouse?

22:56.890 --> 23:01.430
Go home. Back to the slum you were born in.

23:02.290 --> 23:07.000
Can I really go home?

23:07.730 --> 23:12.190
Iason, you must take clear responsibility for your mistakes.

23:12.190 --> 23:17.480
It's not enough to convict only the Furniture.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.740
Go.

23:19.740 --> 23:22.750
While I still haven't changed my mind.

23:33.400 --> 23:36.190
I can go back. This isn't a dream.

23:36.190 --> 23:38.380
I really can go back to the slum.

23:38.380 --> 23:41.650
I won't be bound up anymore.

23:41.650 --> 23:44.970
I... I'm free!

23:45.470 --> 23:47.970
It's for real! I'm free!

23:51.540 --> 23:54.250
You can go home, Riki.

23:56.580 --> 24:00.560
I will give you one year of freedom.

24:00.560 --> 24:05.470
Realize, with your own eyes, that even if you go back to the slum,

24:05.470 --> 24:09.140
you will be a stranger there.

24:09.140 --> 24:12.950
I will wait for that time to come.

24:12.950 --> 24:18.820
And then you will truly be mine. And come back into my arms.

24:18.820 --> 24:21.070
Let's meet again then.
